[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2461.75, "timestamp": "00:41:01", "text": "等等。 正确的？ 我注意到，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2465.03, "timestamp": "00:41:05", "text": "如果没有触发条件，某些网页按钮会一直不停地弹出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2466.71, "timestamp": "00:41:06", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2471.03, "timestamp": "00:41:11", "text": "例如，假设我想要一个按钮，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2478.39, "timestamp": "00:41:18", "text": "每 3 秒检查一次我的 OBS 源（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2480.71, "timestamp": "00:41:20", "text": "我没用 OBS，但严格来说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2484.15, "timestamp": "00:41:24", "text": "OBS 源指的是麦克风之类的设备）是否静音、是否正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2487.109, "timestamp": "00:41:27", "text": "说话等等，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2491.43, "timestamp": "00:41:31", "text": "它会检查设备的可见性等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2493.19, "timestamp": "00:41:33", "text": "所以它实际上是在进行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2495.829, "timestamp": "00:41:35", "text": "检查。我还有一个聊天命令，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2497.829, "timestamp": "00:41:37", "text": "会向 Twitch、YouTube 等平台的聊天室发送消息，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2499.99, "timestamp": "00:41:39", "text": "告知"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2503.109, "timestamp": "00:41:43", "text": "Jo 的麦克风已静音。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2505.43, "timestamp": "00:41:45", "text": "每 3 秒运行一次，显然会造成垃圾信息发送，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2508.15, "timestamp": "00:41:48", "text": "我不想这样。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2512.23, "timestamp": "00:41:52", "text": "希望它只发送一次消息，就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2515.43, "timestamp": "00:41:55", "text": "一次，就一次。如果已经发送过一次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2518.95, "timestamp": "00:41:58", "text": "就不会再发送了。这样就不会"}]